{
  "area": "cli",
  "description": "AGSC-09-18: `mcp --http 0` serves the ten tools over the Streamable HTTP transport of MCP revision 2026-07-28 on a loopback address, the same tools and envelopes as the stdio form. Each request is its own POST to `/mcp` with `Accept` listing `application/json` and `text/event-stream`, `MCP-Protocol-Version: 2026-07-28`, `Mcp-Method` and, for `tools/call`, `Mcp-Name`; each answer is one `application/json` object with HTTP 200. `server-discover` returns the `server/discover` result of AGSC-09-19 with `supportedVersions` of the HTTP transport, which lists the one revision it speaks. `tools-list` returns the ten names in code-point order. `search` returns the AGSC-08-18 envelope in `structuredContent` with `isError` false, and the request that carries a loopback `Origin` (`localhost` with any port) is admitted. No answer carries an `Mcp-Session-Id` header (`headers_absent`).",
  "expected": {
    "http": [
      {
        "body": {
          "id": 1,
          "result": {
            "resultType": "complete",
            "supportedVersions": [
              "2026-07-28"
            ]
          }
        },
        "content_type": "application/json",
        "headers_absent": [
          "mcp-session-id"
        ],
        "name": "server-discover",
        "status": 200
      },
